#. module: muskathlon
#: model:mail.template,body_html:muskathlon.ambassador_donation_confirmation_template
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"invoice_lines\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"donations\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.get_donations()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"donors\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.mapped('partner_id')\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"muskathlon\" t-value=\"partner.registration_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion is glad to inform you that you just received a donation of <t t-out=\"donations[0]\"/>.-\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"donations[1]\">\n"
"                        for the <t t-out=\"donations[1]\"/>.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"len(donors) == 1\">\n"
"                        Your donor is <t t-out=\"donors.preferred_name\"/> from <t t-out=\"donors.city\"/>.\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"donors.email and donors.thankyou_preference != 'none'\">\n"
"                    You can personally thank <t t-out=\"donors.get('him')\"/> if you wish by sending <t t-out=\"donors.get('him')\"/> an e-mail at <a t-attf-href=\"mailto:{{donors.email}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\"><t t-out=\"donors.email\"/></a>. In any case, <t t-out=\"donors.get('he')\"/> will receive a thank you letter from us.\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                        You received this from the following people. You may contact them by e-mail if you wish to thank them personally.\n"
"                        <ul style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;\">\n"
"                            <t t-foreach=\"donors\" t-as=\"donor\">\n"
"                            <li>\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"donor.preferred_name\"/> from <t t-out=\"donor.city\"/>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"donor.email and donor.thankyou_preference != 'none'\">\n"
"                                    (<a t-attf-href=\"mailto:{{donor.email}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\"><t t-out=\"donor.email\"/></a>)\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </li>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </ul>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"muskathlon\">\n"
"                        You currently have raised <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.currency_id.symbol\"/> <t t-out=\"muskathlon.amount_raised\"/>.- You can check your barometer at anytime\n"
"                        <a t-attf-href=\"{{muskathlon.website_url}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\">on your sport profile page</a>.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Yours sincerely\n"
"                </div>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"invoice_lines\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"donations\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.get_donations()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"donors\" t-value=\"invoice_lines.mapped('partner_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"muskathlon\" t-value=\"partner.registration_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"url\" t-value=\"muskathlon.host_url + muskathlon.website_url\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"amount_raised\" t-value=\"'{:.0f}.-'.format(muskathlon.amount_raised or 0.0)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Buone notizie: è con gioia che ti comunichiamo che una nuova donazione di <t t-out=\"donations[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"donations[1]\">\n"
"        per il <t t-out=\"donations[1]\"/> è arrivata grazie a te!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(donors) == 1\">\n"
"        La tua donazione viene da <t t-out=\"donors.preferred_name\"/> residente in <t t-out=\"donors.city\"/>. Puoi ringraziar<t t-out=\"'lo' if donors.gender == 'M' else 'la'\"/> personalmente inviando un email all'indirizzo\n"
"\n"
"        <t t-if=\"donors.email and donors.thankyou_letter != 'no'\">\n"
"            <a t-attf-href=\"mailto:{{donors.email}}\">\n"
"                <t t-out=\"donors.email\"/>\n"
"            </a>\n"
"            . In ogni caso riceverà una lettera di ringraziamento da parte nostra.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Hai ricevuto delle donazioni dalle seguenti persone. Puoi contattarle per e-mail se desideri ringraziarle personalmente.\n"
"</t></p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"donors\" t-as=\"donor\">\n"
"            <li>\n"
"                <t t-out=\"donor.preferred_name\"/> residente in <t t-out=\"donor.city\"/> <t t-out=\"'(' + donor.email + ')' if donor.email and&#10;                donor.thankyou_letter != 'no' else ''\"/>\n"
"            </li>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    \n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"muskathlon\">\n"
"    Hai già raccolto CHF <t t-out=\"amount_raised\"/> Il tuo barometro è stato aggiornato sulla\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{url}}\">\n"
"        tua pagina del profilo.\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Ti auguriamo ogni successo nella preparazione del tuo Muskathlon e nel tuo allenamento. Grazie per il tuo estremo\n"
"impegno contro la povertà estrema!\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Calorosamente\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Compassion Svizzera</body>\n"

#. module: muskathlon
#: model:mail.template,body_html:muskathlon.vaccinations_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Hast du deinen Impfstatus überprüfen lassen? Nimm dir in den nächsten Tagen Zeit um dies zu erledigen.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Bist du ausreichend versichert? Bei deiner Kranken-/Unfallversicherung kannst du dich über die\n"
"    Kostendeckung/-leistung im Ausland informieren. Schliesse allenfalls eine entsprechende Versicherung ab.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Reise-, Annullations- und Auslandkrankenversicherung ist Sache des Teilnehmenden.\n"
"</div>\n"
"<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Möge Gott deine Gesundheit stärken und segnen!\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Fabio, 4M Switzerland\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"   % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"\n"
"% set event = object.get_objects().compassion_event_id\n"
"\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   ${partner.informal_salutation}\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Hast du deinen Impfstatus überprüfen lassen? Nimm dir in den nächsten Tagen Zeit um dies zu erledigen.\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Bist du ausreichend versichert? Bei deiner Kranken-/Unfallversicherung kannst du dich über die Kostendeckung/-leistung im Ausland informieren. Schliesse allenfalls eine entsprechende Versicherung ab.\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   Wir legen dir Nahe Gönner der Rega zu werden. Im Falle einer Repatriierung organisiert die Rega diese und kommt für die ungedeckten Kosten auf. Hier der Link zum Antragsformular der Rega-Gönnerschaft https://www.rega.ch/rega-goenner/goenner-werden?rnw-widget=goenner-werden#goennerschaft-auswaehlen\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <div>\n"
"   <div>\n"
"    Reise-, Annullations- und Auslandkrankenversicherung ist Sache des Teilnehmenden.\n"
"   </div>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <div>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Möge Gott deine Gesundheit stärken und segnen!\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Sara, 4M Switzerland\n"
"  </p>\n"
" "

#. module: muskathlon
#: model:mail.template,body_html:muskathlon.visa_reminder_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Nur noch wenige Wochen bis zu deiner Abreise auf die Philippinen!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Mit Schweizer Nationalität musst du kein Visum für die Einreise beantragen. Falls du aber eine andere Nationalität hast oder länger auf den Philippinen bleiben möchtest, prüfe bitte selbst, ob es dann ein Visum braucht oder nicht.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Für die Einreise braucht es lediglich einen gültigen Reisepass, der bei der Einreise mindestens noch sechs Monate gültig ist, sowie ein Rück- oder Weiterreiseticket.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Wir freuen uns auf dich!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Fabio, 4M Switzerland\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <div>\n"
"   % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"\n"
"% set event = object.get_objects().compassion_event_id\n"
"\n"
"% set country = event.country_id.preposition + ' ' + event.country_id.name\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   ${partner.informal_salutation}\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Hast du schon ein Patenkind ${country} ?\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Falls du dich entschliesst Pate eines Kindes zu werden, besteht für dich die einzigartige Möglichkeit dein Patenkind ${country} zu treffen. Diese Begegnung prägt nicht nur das unterstützte Kind, sondern ist auch ein tief bewegendes Erlebnis für dich! In den Kinderzentren, die wir am Muskathlon besuchen werden, gibt es noch einige Kinder, für die wir dringend einen Paten suchen. Bitte melde dich, dann werden wir dir konkrete Vorschläge senden.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Diese Patenschaft wird dann auch mit CHF 1000 auf deinem Barometer gutgeschrieben.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Falls du bereits ein Patenkind in Ghana hast, welches aber in einer anderen Region lebt, ist wahrscheinlich auch ein Treffen während des Muskathlons möglich. Bitte nimm hierzu so früh wie möglich Kontakt mit Compassion auf.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Herzliche Grüsse\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Merve von Compassion Schweiz\n"
"  </p>\n"
" "

#. module: muskathlon
#: model:mail.template,body_html:muskathlon.ambassador_sponsorship_notification_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"donors\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"muskathlon\" t-value=\"partner.registration_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Compassion is glad to inform you that you just received a sponsorship.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"len(donors) == 1\">\n"
"                        Your donor is <t t-out=\"donors.preferred_name\"></t> from <t t-out=\"donors.city\"></t>.\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"donors.email and donors.thankyou_preference != &#x27;none&#x27;\">\n"
"                    You can personally thank <t t-out=\"donors.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> if you wish by sending <t t-out=\"donors.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> an e-mail at <a t-attf-href=\"mailto:{{donors.email}}\"><t t-out=\"donors.email\"></t></a>. In any case, <t t-out=\"donors.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> will receive a thank you letter from us.\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                        You received this from the following people. You may contact them by e-mail if you wish to thank them personally.\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <t t-foreach=\"donors\" t-as=\"donor\">\n"
"                            <li><t t-out=\"donor.preferred_name\"></t> from <t t-out=\"donor.city\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;(&lt;a href=&quot;{\"></t>\">{}</a>)'.format(donor.email, donor.email) if donor.email and donor.thankyou_preference != 'none' else ''}</li>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </ul>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"muskathlon\">\n"
"                        You currently have raised <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.currency_id.symbol\"></t> <t t-out=\"muskathlon.amount_raised\"></t>.- You can check your barometer at anytime\n"
"                        <a t-attf-href=\"{{muskathlon.website_url}}\">on your sport profile page</a>.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Yours sincerely\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"donor\" t-value=\"sponsorships[:1].partner_id\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"muskathlon\" t-value=\"partner.registration_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Siamo lieti di informarti che <t t-out=\"donor.name\"></t> ha contribuito a finanziare la tua partecipazione al progetto Muskathlon e ha deciso di sostenere un bambino. Per questo, un valore di 1.000 CHF sarà accreditato sul tuo “barometro”.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"donor.email and donor.thankyou_preference != &#x27;none&#x27;\">\n"
"                    Puoi ringraziare personalmente <t t-out=\"donor.firstname\"></t> al seguente indirizzo: <t t-out=\"donor.email\"></t>. Anche noi di Compassion invieremo una lettera di ringraziamento.\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"muskathlon\">\n"
"                        Hai già raccolto <t t-out=\"muskathlon.amount_raised\"></t> <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.currency_id.symbol\"></t>. Puoi verificare il tuo “barometro” in qualsiasi momento\n"
"                        <a t-attf-href=\"{{muskathlon.website_url}}\">nel tuo profilo</a>.\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Ti auguriamo un grande successo nella tua preparazione e nel tuo allenamento per il Muskathlon.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Grazie di cuore per il tuo impegno nella lotta contro la povertà estrema.\n"
"<br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"Cari saluti e a presto!\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: muskathlon
